      28  ## Ideas & Improvements\
      29 +- **International exchange fallback** (implemented): the resolver tries bare                                                                                                                                               \
      30 +  first, then a suffix list driven by input shape. Digits \uc0\u8594  `.HK`, `.TW`,                                                                                                                                                  \
      31 +  `.SS`, `.SZ`, `.T`, `.KS`. Alpha \uc0\u8594  `.L`, `.DE`, `.PA`, `.AS`, `.AX`, `.TO`.                                                                                                                                              \
      32 +  Known edge case: for ambiguous digit codes (e.g. `2330` has both HK and TW                                                                                                                                               \
      33 +  listings), HK wins due to priority order. User can disambiguate by typing                                                                                                                                                \
      34 +  the explicit suffix (`2330.TW`). A future improvement is volume-weighted                                                                                                                                                 \
      35 +  ranking, but it costs an extra Yahoo call per candidate.                                                                                                                                                                 \
      36 +- **Company name + sector pill on Scope header** (implemented): the resolver                                                                                                                                               \
      37 +  fetches `shortName` / `longName` via yfinance on first add and stores it in                                                                                                                                              \
      38 +  `daily_vol.company_name`. Schema migrates via `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN                                                                                                                                                \
      39 +  IF NOT EXISTS`. The Scope header now reads `\uc0\u9672  AAPL  Apple Inc. [Tech]`.                                                                                                                                                  \
      40 +- **Discover as landing page** (implemented): the PDF spec is categorical \'97                                                                                                                                                \
      41 +  users land where the opportunities are, not on an empty Scope.                                                                                                                                                           \
      42 +- **Left-border colored cards** (implemented): Discover cards get a 4px green                                                                                                                                              \
      43 +  / red / blue left accent matching the PDF. Hover lifts with a soft shadow                                                                                                                                                \
      44 +  in the accent color.                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
      45 +- **JetBrains Mono + DM Sans** (implemented): Google Fonts imported, tabular                                                                                                                                               \
      46 +  numerals for data, DM Sans for UI chrome \'97 the Bloomberg-in-your-pocket feel.                                                                                                                                            \
      47 +- **Inline ProgressColumn bars in Scanner** (implemented): `iv_percentile` and                                                                                                                                             \
      48 +  `iv_rank` render as in-cell bars via `st.column_config.ProgressColumn`. No                                                                                                                                               \
      49 +  more flat dataframe.                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
