      43 +  / red / blue left accent matching the PDF. Hover lifts with a soft shadow                                                          \
      44 +  in the accent color.                                                                                                               \
      45 +- **JetBrains Mono + DM Sans** (implemented): Google Fonts imported, tabular                                                         \
