      34      """                                                                                                                                     \
      35 -    Composite crowding score 0-100 from 4 components (equal-weight):                                                                      \
      36 -    - Put/Call ratio z-score                                                                                                                \
      37 -    - Open Interest vs 20-day avg                                                                                                         \
      38 -    - Volume vs 20-day avg                                                                                                                  \
      39 -    - IV-HV spread z-score                                                                                                                \
      35 +    Composite crowding score, 0-100, built from four equal-weight components:                                                        \
