       5  Black-Scholes-Merton solver, and surfaces cheap/rich vol opportunities across a\
       6  curated ticker universe.\
       7  \
       8 -![VolScope hero](docs/hero.png)                                                                                                                                                                                            \
       9 -                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
       8  ## Features\
       9  \
      10  - **Self-computed IV** via Newton-Raphson + bisection BSM solver (never trusts Yahoo's column).\
      11  - **Four historical vol estimators**: close-to-close, Parkinson, Garman-Klass, Yang-Zhang.\
      12  - **IV Rank / IV Percentile / Vol Regime** and IV-HV spread analytics.\
      15 -- **Opportunity dashboard**: cheapest vol, richest premium, daily movers, crowded trades.                                                                                                                                  \
      16 -- **Dark terminal UI** with Plotly charts and a DuckDB backend.                                                                                                                                                            \
      13 +- **Opportunity dashboard**: cheapest vol, richest premium, daily movers, crowded trades, sector vol map, market regime strip.                                                                                             \
      14 +- **On-demand ticker resolver** \'97 any Yahoo symbol (SPY, BRK.B, ^VIX, 1810 \uc0\u8594  HK, BTC-USD) auto-resolves with exchange fallback.                                                                                            \
      15 +- **Full-width scanner** with 1D change, put/call ratio, crowded score, inline progress bars.                                                                                                                              \
      16 +- **Dark terminal UI** with Plotly charts, DuckDB backend, 240+ tests.                                                                                                                                                     \
      17  \
      18  ## Quick Start\
      19  \
      20 +One command. Zero decisions. From a fresh checkout to a running UI in ~30 seconds:                                                                                                                                         \
      21 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      22  ```bash\
      23  git clone <repo> volscope && cd volscope\
      22 -make setup                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
      23 -make run                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
      24 +make quickstart                                                                                                                                                                                                            \
      25  ```\
      26  \
      27 +This installs dependencies, seeds 8 representative tickers (SPY, QQQ, AAPL,                                                                                                                                                \
      28 +NVDA, TSLA, META, GLD, TLT), and launches Streamlit. Your browser opens on                                                                                                                                                 \
      29 +the Discover page and you immediately see real data.                                                                                                                                                                       \
      30 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      31 +**Prerequisites:** Python 3.11 or newer. That's it \'97 no API keys, no database                                                                                                                                              \
      32 +setup, no manual configuration. Yahoo Finance is the only external data                                                                                                                                                    \
      33 +source and it's public.                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
      34 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      35 +### What you don't need                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
      36 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      37 +- No API keys (Yahoo is public)                                                                                                                                                                                            \
      38 +- No database installation (DuckDB is embedded, single file)                                                                                                                                                               \
      39 +- No migration scripts                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
      40 +- No manual config files                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
      41 +- No pre-loaded dataset                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
      42 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      43 +### After Quick Start                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
      44 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      45 +Once the app is running you have three ways to expand the universe:                                                                                                                                                        \
      46 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      47 +1. **Sidebar "Add ticker" box** \'97 type any Yahoo symbol, hit Add, it resolves                                                                                                                                              \
      48 +   and backfills 2 years of history in seconds. Supports international codes:                                                                                                                                              \
      49 +   `1810` auto-resolves to `1810.HK` (Xiaomi on Hong Kong), `LLOY` to `LLOY.L`                                                                                                                                             \
      50 +   (Lloyds on London), etc.                                                                                                                                                                                                \
      51 +2. **Sidebar "Live screener \'97 bulk load"** \'97 one click loads all 280+ tickers                                                                                                                                              \
      52 +   in the curated universe. Takes ~5-10 minutes depending on Yahoo throttling.                                                                                                                                             \
      53 +3. **`make seed-full`** from the terminal \'97 same as option 2 but non-interactive.                                                                                                                                          \
      54 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      55 +## Available Make Targets                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
      56 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      57 +| Target | What it does |                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
      58 +|---|---|                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
      59 +| `make quickstart` | **Everything.** Install deps + 8-ticker seed + start UI. Run this first. |                                                                                                                           \
      60 +| `make setup` | Install Python dependencies only. |                                                                                                                                                                       \
      61 +| `make run` | Start the Streamlit UI (assumes you already have data). |                                                                                                                                                   \
      62 +| `make seed-starter` | Seed the 8-ticker starter pack. Same as the seed step in `quickstart`. |                                                                                                                           \
      63 +| `make seed-full` | Seed the entire curated universe (~280 tickers, ~5-10 min). |                                                                                                                                         \
      64 +| `make seed` | Alias for `seed-full` (kept for compatibility with cron). |                                                                                                                                                \
      65 +| `make scrape` | Live options chain scrape \'97 updates real IV for every loaded ticker. Intended for cron. |                                                                                                                \
      66 +| `make test` | Run the full pytest suite (240+ tests). |                                                                                                                                                                  \
      67 +| `make verify` | Run the 4-gate verification: spec conformance, regression, golden values, runtime smoke. |                                                                                                               \
      68 +| `make clean` | Delete the local database. |                                                                                                                                                                              \
      69 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      70 +## Daily Data Refresh                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
      71 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      72 +VolScope distinguishes **historical backfill** (HV from Yahoo OHLCV) from                                                                                                                                                  \
      73 +**live IV** (today's options chain). `make quickstart` only does the                                                                                                                                                       \
      74 +historical backfill \'97 it gives you 2 years of HV data with a YZ \'d7 1.12 VRP                                                                                                                                                 \
      75 +proxy for the IV column. To get real options-chain IV, run:                                                                                                                                                                \
      76 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      77 +```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \
      78 +make scrape                                                                                                                                                                                                                \
      79 +```                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
      80 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      81 +Or wire it into cron:                                                                                                                                                                                                      \
      82 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      83 +```                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
      84 +30 16 * * 1-5 cd /path/to/volscope && /usr/bin/make scrape                                                                                                                                                                 \
      85 +```                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \
      86 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      87 +(4:30pm on weekdays, after US market close.)                                                                                                                                                                               \
      88 +                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
      89  ## Architecture\
      90  \
      91  ```\
