      121 +2. **Sidebar "Live screener \'97 bulk load"** \'97 loads the full curated universe.                                                                                                                                                                               \
      122 +3. **Edit `volscope/data/ticker_universe.py`** \'97 adds a ticker to the persistent                                                                                                                                                                            \
