  iv_rank: `(current - min) / (max - min) * 100`. Return 50.0 if max == min.\
  iv_percentile: `count(history < current) / len(history) * 100`\
  vol_regime: Returns `\{"regime": "HIGH"|"LOW"|"NORMAL", "z_score": float, "mean": float, "std": float\}`\
  iv_hv_spread: Returns `\{"spread": float, "ratio": float, "signal": "RICH"|"CHEAP"|"NEUTRAL", "z_score": float|None\}`\
    - RICH if spread > 0 and ratio > 1.1\
    - CHEAP if spread < 0 and ratio < 0.9\
    - NEUTRAL otherwise\
