       1 """\
       2 Earnings IV crush estimator.\
       3\
       4 For each historical earnings event in the DB, measure iv_30d roughly 5\
       5 trading days before vs 1 trading day after, then compute the crush % as:\
       6     crush = (iv_after - iv_before) / iv_before * 100\
       7\
       8 Negative crush % = IV dropped (typical post-earnings). Positive = IV rose.\
