\uc0\u9210  Before creating the triggers, there's a critical constraint to surface: VolScope is not in a git repo, and the working directory is your local Mac at /Users/tomschoen/Desktop/VolScope. Remote triggers run in Anthropic's cloud sandbox\
  \'97 they can't access your local filesystem or a non-existent GitHub repo.\
\
  Two real options:\
\
  Option A \'97 Local launchd agents (recommended)\
  Create 5 macOS launchd plist files that run claude -p "<prompt>" at each scheduled time. Runs on your actual machine with full access to /Users/tomschoen/Desktop/VolScope. Requires VolScope to be in git first (or uses the filesystem\
  directly).\
\
  Option B \'97 Push VolScope to GitHub first, then use RemoteTrigger\
